<title>UK: Great Belt sets 100 mln mark 6-year structured FRN.</title>
<headline>Great Belt sets 100 mln mark 6-year structured FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Bankhaus AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GREAT BELT A/S</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    22.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     **	  PAY DATE    22.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   ISS PRICE  100	 FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** PLUS 30 BP IF 6ML IS LOWER THAN 8.0 PCT.</p>
<p>IF 6ML ABOVE 8.0 PCT PAYS 24.3 PCT MINUS (2X6ML).  </p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  DENMARK   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
